# @GAME_TITLE@

Generated with `scripts/new-game.sh @GAME_NAME@ --headless` (template `headless`): no window, no
GPU and no SDL. It runs 600 deterministic frames (`ManualClock`) and verifies its own result
(exit code 1 on failure).

```bash
cmake --preset dev
cmake --build --preset dev --target run-@GAME_NAME@
cmake --build --preset dev && ctest --preset dev -R @GAME_NAME@
```
